MMU Luka Design Report
======================

Scope
-----
This report explains why `mmu_luka` works, and how it implements the tasks you defined.
Files covered:
- `HLS-Verilog/MMU/mmu_luka.hpp`
- `HLS-Verilog/MMU/mmu_luka.cpp`
- `HLS-Verilog/MMU/mmu_luka_tb.cpp`

Validation status
-----------------
- Host compile check passed:
  - `g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -I HLS-Verilog -I /tools/Xilinx/2025.1/Vitis/include HLS-Verilog/MMU/mmu_luka.cpp HLS-Verilog/MMU/mmu_luka_tb.cpp HLS-Verilog/Weight_Loader-Stager/Weight_stager.cpp -o /tmp/mmu_luka_tb`
